Phase 0 — Overview

Phase 0 establishes the complete foundation for the FocusUP Clone. By the end of this phase, the monorepo is fully wired, all infrastructure services are running locally via Docker, the database schema is migrated, and both the Express server and Next.js web app can communicate end-to-end.

✓  The Better T Stack scaffold is already in place. Phase 0 is not a setup from scratch — the goal is to wire the existing pieces together and adapt them to the FocusUP domain.


